      "help_en": "The ID of the destination Alibaba Cloud region to which you want to migrate the source.\n\nFor example, if you want to migrate a source server to the China (Hangzhou) region, set RegionId to `cn-hangzhou`. You can call https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html to view the latest list of Alibaba Cloud regions",
